    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR introduces an explicit spec parameter to model whether the machine-level `mcountinhibit` CSR exists, and uses it to conditionally enable related spec elements/configs (needed for ACT4).\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add new boolean parameter `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED` (defined under `Sm`).\n- Gate `COUNTINHIBIT_EN` and the `mcountinhibit` CSR definition behind `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED == true`.\n- Update several example/test configs to set `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED: true`, and tweak pre-commit exclusions.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 12 out of 12 changed files in this pull request and generated 1 comment.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| spec/std/isa/param/MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED.yaml | New parameter defining whether `mcountinhibit` is implemented. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/param/COUNTINHIBIT_EN.yaml | `definedBy` now requires `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED == true`. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/csr/Zicntr/mcountinhibit.yaml | CSR now conditional on `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED == true` (generated output). |\r\n| spec/std/isa/csr/Zicntr/mcountinhibit.layout | Source template updated to match the new conditional definition. |\r\n| cfgs/rv64-vector.yaml | Set `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED: true`. |\r\n| cfgs/rv64-riscv-tests.yaml | Set `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED: true`. |\r\n| cfgs/rv32-vector.yaml | Set `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED: true`. |\r\n| cfgs/rv32-riscv-tests.yaml | Set `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED: true`. |\r\n| cfgs/qc_iu.yaml | Set `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED: true`. |\r\n| cfgs/mc100-32-full-example.yaml | Set `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED: true`. |\r\n| cfgs/example_rv64_with_overlay.yaml | Document + set `MCOUNTINHIBIT_IMPLEMENTED: true`. |\r\n| .pre-commit-config.yaml | Exclude `mcountinhibit.yaml` from `end-of-file-fixer`. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions